<h1 class='center-h'>About</h1>

<h3 class='center-h'>
Mission
</h3>

<p>
Introduce symbolic logic programming into game development.  
Establish it as a tool for clear specification of game logic.
</p>

<h3 class='center-h'>
Principles and Project Philosophy
</h3>

<p>
  SymOntoClay is built on a philosophy of declarativity, clarity, and human-readability.  
  Learn more in the <a href="/docs/philosophy.html">Principles and Project Philosophy</a> section.
</p>

<h3 class='center-h'>
